  "title": "Silenced Tongues",
  "description": "Discover the ceremonial weapons within Volunruud to open the Elder's Cairn and defeat the ancient draugr chieftain Kvenel the Tongue.",
  "npc_facts": {
    "Kvenel": {
      "base_facts": [
        "I am Kvenel the Tongue, an ancient chieftain entombed within Volunruud's Elder's Cairn.",
        "I wield two ice-enchanted weapons: the sword Eduj and the axe Okin.",
        "My conjurer minion serves me from beyond the grave, summoning atronachs and casting frost spells."
      ],
      "beat_facts": {
        "CAIRN_OPENED": [
          "An intruder has breached the Elder's Cairn and approaches my throne."
        ],
        "KVENEL_DEFEATED": [
          "Kvenel's ghostly form has been laid to rest; his weapons Eduj and Okin can be claimed.",
          "Kvenel the Tongue defeated; quest complete. Rewards include Eduj, Okin, and a Word of Power for Aura Whisper.",
          "At the next fork, the northerly passage on your left leads to the balcony across from the one where you entered the last room, so if you wish to loot the draugr you range-killed as you entered, this is the best time to.",
          "Finding the Weapons [ edit ] The next room is a hub chamber with 4 passages radiating off in different directions."
        ]
      }
    }
  },
